Problem
A game tracks points scored by players on successive days. For each gender, calculate total as the cumulative score through the current day, preserving the input order when multiple scores share a day. Return the gender, day, and cumulative total ordered by gender and day.

Output columns: gender, day, total

day identifies the relevant day.

--- write SQL Query here
select 
    gender,
    "day",
    sum(score_point) over(partition by gender order by "day" asc
    rows between unbounded preceding and current row)  as total
    from scores
order by gender, day;
